OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after stolen cabling
OL,4,Aseized from lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of theft after a lorry
OL,8,Fbelieved to contain stolen cabling was
OL,9,Fstopped by police.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said officers
OL,12,Fwere called in the early hours of
OL,13,FWednesday morning after cabling was
OL,14,Freported stolen from a site near
OL,15,FNorthampton.
OL,17,FThe force said a "suspicious truck" was
OL,18,Fidentified shortly before 03:45 BST and
OL,19,Ffollowed as it made its way north
OL,20,Ftowards Nottinghamshire.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
