OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after stolen cabling
OL,4,Aseized from lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FShortly after 05:00, police used a
OL,7,Fstinger device to stop the lorry as it
OL,8,Fleft the A46 and joined the A606 in
OL,9,Fsouth Nottinghamshire.
